  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Judicial System Strengthening Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to strengthen an independent judiciary capable of providing justice for all and guaranteeing the rule of law in Uzbekistan. Through this program, USAID intends to work in close partnership with the countrys core judicial administration bodies that are mandated to guarantee judicial independence, efficiency, and accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
